      "text": "KEY IDEA \u2014 the browser talks to BOTH backends:\n  \u2022 Node gateway = patient records + auth  (JWT is verified HERE)\n  \u2022 Flask service = the AI compute, called DIRECTLY by the browser\nAuth lives in the gateway; Flask is meant to be the internal compute\nservice (in prod it would sit behind the gateway / verify the JWT).",
